BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 455.09 Td (Q: I woke up ill. Who do I tell?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 440.69 Td (A: Your line manager, before 09:00, and register the absence in the HR portal the same day.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 418.29 Td (Q: Do I get paid on my first day of sickness?) Tj ET
