BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 367.09 Td (A: From day eight of the sickness period, counting weekends. Upload it in the HR portal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 344.69 Td (Q: My child is ill. What do I do?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 330.29 Td (A: Tell your manager before 09:00, register VAB in the HR portal and apply to Försäkringskassan for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 315.89 Td (benefit.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 293.49 Td (Q: I got ill on vacation. Do I lose those vacation days?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 279.09 Td (A: No, if you report it on the first day and provide a medical certificate from the first day of sickness.) Tj ET
